{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "fa4ae3a0-9c7c-89b6-8821-8c8e88b920f1",
  "created_at": "2026-01-29T11:21:20-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sarah Nguyen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:18:56-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:18:59-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, hi. My name's Sarah Nguyen. I'm calling about the roads, the ice. Can you hear me okay? I'm kind of in a spot with bad reception."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:19:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you, a little choppy. Go ahead, Sarah."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:19:15-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So I'm stopped in my car right now on the approach to the Newport Bridge, like [line breaks up] traffic's crawling and everybody's sliding a bit. It's just a sheet of ice. It's from that snow-to-rain storm Sunday into Monday, it all froze up after."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:19:33-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You broke up on me there. You're on the bridge approach, and the road's icy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:19:39-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, the bridge approach, but that's not actually what I'm calling about. Well, it's the same thing. My street's the same. I'm on Bellevue Avenue, 165 Bellevue, and it's wicked slick the whole way down. It needs sand or salt, something."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:19:55-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 165 Bellevue Avenue. And has a plow been down there since the storm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:20:01-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One came through, I think Monday, but that was before the rain turned it to ice. Nothing since. [inaudible] So can you get a plow to come back, and sand it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:20:13-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put in the request for Bellevue for a return pass and sanding. Can you say the number one more time? I want to make sure I have it right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:20:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, 165. One six five Bellevue Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:20:29-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And the bridge itself isn't ours, that's the bridge authority, but I can flag the approach road if it's city. Which side of the bridge are you on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:20:41-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, the Newport side, coming off toward town. I'm not moving much so I can see it. Just ice, all of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:20:50-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll note that too. Crews are stretched thin after a storm like that, so I can't give you a time, but it goes on the list for today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:21:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Do you need a number for me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:21:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If you'd like to leave one, sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:21:08-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0191."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:21:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-one. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:21:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Okay, thanks. I gotta go, traffic's moving."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T11:21:17-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Drive careful, Sarah. Bye now."
    }
  ],
